## Testing

Components that only render what they are given are not unit-tested for logic
— they have none. Behaviour is tested in the presentation model
(`{{TESTING_SKILL}}`). If a component seems to need a behaviour test, it holds
behaviour that belongs one step in.

## Checklist before reporting

- [ ] Searched the existing tiers before creating anything.
- [ ] File in the right tier and path.
- [ ] No state/effect/memo hook beyond the narrow exception, no application access, no rule.
- [ ] Platform rules followed.
- [ ] Split where a block has its own identity; nothing over-split.
- [ ] Preview present where the preview rule requires one.
